            "detailed_description": "Manga are comics created in Japan. The problem for most people is, as they're made in Japan they're only produced in Japanese; someone has to translate them to English! Is one man able to accomplish this? Is there more to his team's relationships other than business? Can everything in a translator's life be simple and clear?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Girls in swimsuits. Everyone likes girls in swimsuits!<br></li><li> Unique graphics, story, music. All was made especially for this game.<br></li><li> Four endings: 2 bad endings, one normal and one good.<br></li><li> Two languages: English and Russian.<br></li><li> Achievements: To get all 12 achievements you need to play about an hour or two.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Manga are comics created in Japan. The problem for most people is, as they're made in Japan they're only produced in Japanese; someone has to translate them to English! Is one man able to accomplish this? Is there more to his team's relationships other than business? Can everything in a translator's life be simple and clear?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Girls in swimsuits. Everyone likes girls in swimsuits!<br></li><li> Unique graphics, story, music. All was made especially for this game.<br></li><li> Four endings: 2 bad endings, one normal and one good.<br></li><li> Two languages: English and Russian.<br></li><li> Achievements: To get all 12 achievements you need to play about an hour or two.</li></ul>",
